<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Valentine For You ❤️</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
}

.slide {
  display: none;
  height: 100vh;
  width: 100vw;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  padding: 20px;
}

.active {
  display: flex;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 3em;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

p {
  font-size: 1.5em;
  max-width: 600px;
}

button {
  padding: 12px 25px;
  font-size: 18px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 25px;
  background: white;
  color: #ff4d6d;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
  transform: scale(1.1);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Slide 1 -->
<div class="slide active" id="slide1">
  <h1>Will You Be My Valentine? ❤️</h1>
  <button onclick="nextSlide()">Klik Aku</button>
</div>

<!-- Slide 2 -->
<div class="slide" id="slide2">
  <h1>Untuk babyy 💕</h1>
  <p>
    Maaf buat giftnya yang simple ini babyy,  
    Aku cuma mww bilang kalau aku bersyukur bisa kenal kamu.  
    Semoga kita bisa punya lebih banyak waktu kedepanya yaa 
    Happy Valentine's Day Felensyaaaa ❤️ 
    <br><br>
    I Love U So Much ❤️
  </p>
</div>

<script>
function nextSlide() {
  document.getElementById("slide1").classList.remove("active");
  document.getElementById("slide2").classList.add("active");
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
